  "truncatedDescription": "Two amateur art critics meet in a gallery and argue passionately about the pieces they see, until finally they find a piece on which they can agree...\r\n\r\nAll of the visuals of the film have been realized using Blender and other free/open source so...",
  "description": "Two amateur art critics meet in a gallery and argue passionately about the pieces they see, until finally they find a piece on which they can agree...\r\n\r\nAll of the visuals of the film have been realized using Blender and other free/open source software, the film itself and all the assets are being released open and free as Creative Commons CC-BY.\r\n\r\nYou can support us by joining Blender Cloud, a monthly subscription that makes projects like this possible:\r\n\r\nhttps://cloud.blender.org/\r\n\r\nDirected by: Beorn Leonard\r\nProduced by: Ton Roosendaal, Blender Institute",
